==Trivia==
*The trident is a reference to the trident of the Greek god of seas, {{wp|Poseidon}}.
*The trident of the seas is the ''[[Old School RuneScape]]'' equivalent to the {{RSL|polypore staff}} from ''{{RSL|RuneScape}}''.

